    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Evaluate this candidate against the job requirements and provide a detailed assessment.\n\nCANDIDATE PROFILE:\nName:{{ $('Information Extractor').item.json.output.name }}\nSkills:{{ $('Information Extractor').item.json.output.skills }}\nProjects:{{ $('Information Extractor').item.json.output.projects }}\nEducation:{{ $('Information Extractor').item.json.output.education }}\nexperience:{{ $('Information Extractor').item.json.output.experience_years }}\n\n\nJOB DESCRIPTION:\nJob title:{{ $json.job_title }}\nlocation:{{ $json.location }}\nexperience:{{ $json.experience_required }}\njob summery:{{ $json.job_summary }}\nrequired skills:{{ $json.required_skills }}\npreffered skills:{{ $json.preferred_skills }}\nKey responsibilities:{{ $json.key_responsibilities }}\nMust Have tools:{{ $json.minimum_requirements.must_have_tools }}\n\nAlways output the Decision As \"Shortlisted\" or \"Rejected\" \n\nAnalyze the candidate and return your evaluation in this exact JSON format:\n{\n  \"score\": 85,\n  \"decision\": \"Shortlist\",\n  \"strengths\": [\"List 3-5 key strengths that match the role\"],\n  \"gaps\": [\"List 2-4 missing skills or experience gaps\"],\n  \"summary\": \"2-3 sentence overall assessment\",\n  \"experience_match\": \"Strong/Moderate/Weak\",\n  \"skills_match_percentage\": 75\n}\n\nScoring Guidelines:\n- 80-100: Excellent match, strong shortlist\n- 60-79: Good match, consider for interview\n- 40-59: Partial match, review carefully\n- 0-39: Poor match, likely reject",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert HR recruiter and talent evaluator. Your job is to compare a candidate's profile against a job description and provide an objective assessment.\n\nRules:\n- Be fair and objective in your evaluation\n- Consider both technical skills match and overall experience\n- Identify specific strengths and gaps\n- Provide a numerical score from 0-100\n- Base your recommendation on the score and requirements match"
        }
      },
